Floor3D Pro Add-ons

This independent companion is based on the owner's existing rendering/light-pool
and GLB compatibility scripts. It does not redistribute the Floor3D Pro card or
the owner's model, dashboard, household data or device configuration.

Upstream lineage and acknowledgements:
- Floor3D Pro Card by Levent ERDEM: https://github.com/levonisyas/floor3dpro-card
- Original floor3d-card by Andrea Di Zanni: https://github.com/adizanni/floor3d-card
- Three.js: https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js

The native card and its bundled Three.js are installed separately. Three.js is
a development/test dependency only and is not included in the add-on bundle.

For completeness, the MIT notice from the separately installed Floor3D Pro
project is retained below. This is attribution, not a claim of endorsement.

